  <core:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Different units of measures to represent different levels of granularity. It has eight units as the instances: "Second", "Minute", "Hour", "Day", "Week", "Month", "Season", "Year".</core:definition>
