  <unti:Definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">One of the convolutions on the medial surface of the CEREBRAL HEMISPHERES. It surrounds the rostral part of the brain and CORPUS CALLOSUM and forms part of the LIMBIC SYSTEM.</unti:Definition>
