  <core:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Typical way of life or manner of living characteristic of an individual or group. (From APA, Thesaurus of Psychological Index Terms, 8th ed) (MSH)
 A manner of living that reflects the person's values and attitudes. (NCI)
 Typical way of life or manner of living characteristic of an individual or groups. (PSY)
 Typical way of life or manner of living characteristic of an individual or group. (CSP)
 https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C0023676</core:definition>
