 Detectable changes in behavior due to psychotherapeutic, behavioral, or other intervention, or spontaneous occurrence. (PSY)
 https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C0542299</core:definition>
  <UMLS_CUI rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">C0542299</UMLS_CUI>
