  <core:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Employment involving less than the standard or customary working time. (NCI)
 Employment in which the employee is expected to work less than a standard work week (defined by the US Bureau of Labor Statistics as 35-44 hours per week)

 (HL7V3.0)

 https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C0682294</core:definition>
