  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Student</rdfs:label>
  <core:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Individuals enrolled in a school or formal educational program. (MSH)
 A person who is enrolled in an educational institution. (NCI)
 Covered party to an insurance policy has coverage through full-time or part-time attendance at a recognized educational institution as defined by a particular insurance policy.

 (HL7V3.0)
 A role played by an individual who is a student of a school, which is the scoping entity.

 (HL7V3.0)
 Persons attending school. Use a more specific term if possible. (PSY)

 https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C0038492</core:definition>
  <UMLS_CUI rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">C0038492</UMLS_CUI>
