  <core:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Convenient availability to affordable foods that support healthy eating patterns. Access may be limited due to having a limited income or living far away from sources of healthful and affordable food. (MSH)
 https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C5544471</core:definition>
  <UMLS_CUI rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">C5544471</UMLS_CUI>
