 The condition of being treated as a patient in a hospital. (NCI)
 https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C0019993</core:definition>
  <UMLS_CUI rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">C0019993</UMLS_CUI>
